      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The next update will have the indicator on the UI layer and thus hidable by de-selecting the UI mask in the camera and mirrors. If UI is enabled, it will still be shown. This is the same behaviour as the lens itself, as well as the nameplate above it.\n\nIf you were requesting that the indicator be hidden entirely in camera photos, please open a new task explaining your reasoning specifically and mark it as a feature request. Thanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
